{"id":"sh/mlsji9cf","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":420,"top":182,"width":786,"height":112},"text":"Supervisor selects catalog options, lodging tier and activity cadence. Three advisory specialist nodes inspect the proposal and retrieved evidence.","style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#365148","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/7m10red0","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":68,"top":327,"width":328,"height":110},"text":"Independent critique","style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#123D34","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/bmpkv6d4","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":420,"top":327,"width":786,"height":112},"text":"Tools price the full trip and check timing, walking, occupancy and caps. In the demo the initial plan costs $1,056 per person against an $850 cap.","style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#365148","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/alw3m1wz","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":68,"top":472,"width":328,"height":110},"text":"Observed repair","style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#123D34","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/xo72xgva","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":420,"top":472,"width":786,"height":112},"text":"A bounded tool prices feasible alternatives. The real model selects one; reconstruction passes at $770 per person. At most two repair passes.","style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#365148","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
